      "evidence_id": "S2",
      "en": "The setRetryAfterHeaderIfNeeded method returns immediately if the retryAfterFn function is nil.",
      "pt-br": "A função setRetryAfterHeaderIfNeeded retorna imediatamente se a função retryAfterFn for nula."
